- (q) Pennants and streamers; (r) Mechanical fan and wind activated devices;

- (s) Signs not in good repair, specifically including any sign which is in a state of disassembly or any sign which has internal lighting exposed to view.

- (t) Any ground-based monument sign that is located on property zoned residential and is not located at least thirty feet (30’) from the right-of- way.
